    "Or start by pressing the Action Button and talking. Pull up the KeyVox keyboard and tap the dictation button. Turn your speech into text." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for the dictation shortcut setup video demonstrating starting dictation with the Action Button and finishing it on the keyboard. KeyVox is a brand name and stays in English; use Apple's official name for the Action Button in this language.",
